                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17309513" author="ascherbakov" created="Fri, 26 Mar 2021 15:48:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The issue is caused by the race during processing of near atomic update request and concurrent client PME.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If the request is validated during active client PME, updateAllAsyncInternal0 can be called recursively and re-acquires entry locks, causing unlockEntry not actually release locks and triggering assertion.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The fix is to remove extra server side validation, because it&#8217;s already performed in GridNearAtomicAbstractUpdateFuture.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17310759" author="ignitetcbot" created="Mon, 29 Mar 2021 16:18:22 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Branch: &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;pull/8939/head&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Base: &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;master&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; : No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #F7D6C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Branch: &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;pull/8939/head&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Base: &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;master&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; : No new tests found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=5936522&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17310767" author="ascherbakov" created="Mon, 29 Mar 2021 16:25:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;List of changes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Removed useless validation on DHT primary node.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Fixed NPE in exchange future.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Reverted the change causing performance drop for SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Fixed a bug when lost partitions are not detected on client cache start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sk0x50&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sk0x50&quot;&gt;sk0x50&lt;/a&gt;&#160;Can you take a look ?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17310855" author="slava.koptilin" created="Mon, 29 Mar 2021 18:00:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hello &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ascherbakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ascherbakov&quot;&gt;ascherbakov&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The proposed patch looks good to me.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
